@dailyTimeWorker_HostAddress = https://localhost:5510

### Health
GET {{dailyTimeWorker_HostAddress}}/api/health

### Procesar portales encolados
POST {{dailyTimeWorker_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/scrape/queued

### Forzar scrape de un portal
POST {{dailyTimeWorker_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/scrape/1

### Estado notificaciones
GET {{dailyTimeWorker_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/status

### Enviar correo (requiere SMTP configurado)
POST {{dailyTimeWorker_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "tu@correo.com",
  "subject": "Prueba DailyTime",
  "body": "Hola desde el worker",
  "isHtml": false
}
